  "seo": {
    "bodyHtml": "Discover the excellence of Hermès wallets, an essential collection designed for women and men. Fashioned from exceptional <a href=\"/us/en/category/leather-goods/small-leather-goods/wallets/?facet_material=cuir\">leathers</a>, our models combine aesthetics and practicality. From the classic long format to <a href=\"/us/en/category/leather-goods/small-leather-goods/wallets/?facet_category=portefeuilles_compact_et_mini\">compact wallets</a>, each piece is designed for daily use, just like our clever <a href=\"/us/en/category/leather-goods/small-leather-goods/wallets/?facet_category=porte_monnaies\">coin purses</a>. Find the emblematic signature of the <a href=\"/us/en/category/leather-goods/small-leather-goods/wallets/?facet_line=kelly\">Kelly</a> line and an elegant color palette, from timeless <a href=\"/us/en/category/leather-goods/small-leather-goods/wallets/?facet_color=black\">black</a> to natural <a href=\"/us/en/category/leather-goods/small-leather-goods/wallets/?facet_color=brown\">brown</a>. Gold or silver finishes enhance these durable creations."
  },
